&lt;p&gt;ANINE BING is seeking an &lt;strong&gt;RTW Freelance Fashion Designer&lt;/strong&gt; for a mission-based engagement supporting ready-to-wear collection development, in coordination with our Paris-based design team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This mission covers design contribution across our RTW offer, with a &lt;strong&gt;priority focus on flou and tailoring&lt;/strong&gt;, for designers who bring a versatile, hands-on skillset and &lt;strong&gt;a minimum of 3 years of professional experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a fashion design studio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Scope:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to design and development across RTW categories, with a &lt;strong&gt;priority focus on flou and tailoring&lt;/strong&gt; (jersey exposure a plus), aligned with agreed collection deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce technical drawings and design packs on Illustrator, delivered per the agreed milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to silhouette refinement based on fitting feedback, incorporating revisions into technical drawings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to color, fabric and trim research to support collection deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure deliverables reflect brand design intent, for handoff to Product Development and Production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum 3 years of professional experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a fashion design studio, ideally within a contemporary or premium ready-to-wear brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong design skillset in &lt;strong&gt;flou and tailoring&lt;/strong&gt;; jersey experience a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert-level command of Illustrator and Photoshop is mandatory&lt;/strong&gt;, with solid technical drawing and garment construction knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous and able to manage deliverables independently against a defined scope and timeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; French professional proficiency preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Terms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent contractor status (freelance / auto-entrepreneur or registered company); this is a service engagement, not an employment position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial time commitment expected given the volume of deliverables across the collection cycle; scope, milestones and workload are defined with the Senior Designer, with day-to-day work organization managed by the contractor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional on-site presence in Paris may be required for fittings; otherwise remote.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A portfolio is required to apply. Applications submitted without a portfolio cannot be considered.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
